DTSTART:20261108T010000Z
DURATION:PT1H
SUMMARY:Monkey SMP: Season I opens
DESCRIPTION:Season I opens and everyone is let in at once. 5 PM Pacific\, 8
  PM Eastern. Your calendar shows it in your own time. Server address: monk
 eysmp.lscaturchio.xyz.
LOCATION:Monkey SMP\, Minecraft Java: monkeysmp.lscaturchio.xyz
URL:https://monkeysmp.lscaturchio.xyz/guide
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
